          "start": "2024-01-29",
          "end": "2025-01-26"
        },
        "value": "114.20",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C2",
      "text": "The SEGMENT_04 segment's revenue grew by 145.11% from $47,405 million in the year ended January 28, 2024, to $116,193 million in the year ended January 26, 2025, driven by strong demand for accelerated computing and AI solutions, specifically a 162% growth in Data Center computing revenue and a 51% growth in Data Center networking revenue (calculated from reported values; filing shows 145% rounded).",
